msgstr "美式（NMJL）"

msgid "American Civil War"
msgstr "美国内战"

msgid "American Mah-Jongg. Assemble hands with jokers, and declare other players' hands dead. Rules are slightly different from MJME 2024 (see rules page)."
msgstr "美式麻将。以王牌组成牌型，并宣告其他玩家的手牌死手。规则与 MJME 2024 略有不同（请见规则页）。"

msgid "Anetai Toyone"
msgstr "姉帯豊音"

msgid "Anfuun"
msgstr "暗风"

msgid "Animal Set"
msgstr "动物组"

msgid "Animal Tile"
msgstr "动物牌"

msgid "Animal Tiles"
msgstr "动物牌"

msgid "Ankan"
msgstr "暗杠"

msgid "Another way to think about it is to have 234567 in one suit, 123 in a second suit, and 345 in the third suit OR 234567 in one suit, 456 in a second suit, and 678 in the third suit."
msgstr "另一种理解方式是：在某一花色拥有 234567、第二花色拥有 123、第三花色拥有 345；或是某一花色拥有 234567、第二花色拥有 456、第三花色拥有 678。"

msgid "Another way to think about it is to have either 123 234 345 567 or 123 345 456 567."
msgstr "另一种理解方式是：拥有 123 234 345 567 或 123 345 456 567。"

msgid "Anything Joker (縂)"
msgstr "万能王牌（縂）"

msgid "Anyways, that's basically all the new calls in cosmic riichi! The call priority is as follows:"
msgstr "总之，以上基本上就是宇宙立直中所有新增的鸣牌！鸣牌优先顺序如下："

msgid "Ao"
msgstr "青"

msgid "Aotenjou"
msgstr "青天井"

msgid "Applied oka of %{ante} chips."
msgstr "已套用 %{ante} 个筹码的赌注（オカ）。"

msgid "Applied oka of %{ante}."
msgstr "已套用 %{ante} 的赌注（オカ）。"

msgid "Applied uma of %{_1st}/%{_2nd}/%{_3rd}/%{_4th} chips."
msgstr "已套用 %{_1st}/%{_2nd}/%{_3rd}/%{_4th} 个筹码的名次奖金（ウマ）。"

msgid "Applied uma of %{_1st}/%{_2nd}/%{_3rd}/%{_4th}."
msgstr "已套用 %{_1st}/%{_2nd}/%{_3rd}/%{_4th} 的名次奖金（ウマ）。"

