msgstr "赌注（オカ）"

msgid "Oka applies directly to chips."
msgstr "赌注（オカ）直接套用于筹码。"

msgid "Okay, do you go for the wider wait by declaring riichi on the wind, or jump for the funny wind wait by discarding 8 of bamboo?"
msgstr "好，你是要以风牌宣告立直来求更宽广的听牌，还是打出 8 索来追求那个有趣的风牌听？"

msgid "On ron, each 1s (bird) tile is worth 1 shuugi, unless the discarder's hand contains 7p (pistol) which would shoot the birds dead. That is, unless the winner's hand contains 8s (birdcage) which would protect the birds from gunfire."
msgstr "荣和时，每张 1 索（鸟）值 1 个筹码，除非放枪者手牌中含有 7 筒（手枪）会将鸟射杀。也就是说，除非和牌者手牌中含有 8 索（鸟笼）能保护鸟免于枪火。"

msgid "On top of our mixed straight, we get our two flower tiles, plus All Chows (all sequences plus non-honor pair), totalling 12 points."
msgstr "在我们的混龙之外，还有两张花牌，加上全顺（全为顺子加非字牌雀头），合计 12 点。"

msgid "One Flower"
msgstr "一花"

msgid "One Kong"
msgstr "一杠"

msgid "One Suji Only"
msgstr "仅一筋"

msgid "One Voided Suit"
msgstr "缺一门"

msgid "One of each dragon tile is a special tile. The special white dragon is shiro pocchi, which acts a joker tile when drawn while in riichi. The special green dragon is an aka dora. The special red dragon is the golden chun, which can be used as a five of any suit, and grants 1 han when used as a five. Completing a hand via shiro pocchi while using the golden chun as a five and having the aka green dragon scores yakuman. If playing with shuugi, a golden chun used as a five scores 2 shuugi."
msgstr "每种三元牌各有一张特殊牌。特殊的白是白发财，在立直中摸到时可作为王牌。特殊的发是赤宝牌。特殊的中是金中，可作为任何花色的五，用作五时给予 1 番。透过白发财和了、同时将金中用作五并拥有赤发，即计为役满。若以筹码游玩，用作五的金中计 2 个筹码。"

msgid "One of each tile is replaced with a blue 'galaxy' tile that acts as a wildcard of its number. For example, %{galaxy_3s} can be used as any of %{threes}. Galaxy winds are wind wildcards, and galaxy dragons are dragon wildcards."
msgstr "每种牌各有一张被替换为蓝色的「银河」牌，可作为其数字的万能牌。例如 %{galaxy_3s} 可作为 %{threes} 中任何一张。银河风牌为风牌的万能牌，银河三元牌为三元牌的万能牌。"

msgid "One of the eight 7p and one of the eight 7s is rainbow-colored. They are worth 10 shuugi each (same as how gold dora is worth 1)."
msgstr "八张 7 筒中的一张及八张 7 索中的一张为彩虹色。它们各值 10 个筹码（如同金宝牌值 1 般）。"

msgid "One of the green dragons %{6z} is replaced with hatsu pocchi %{hatsu_pocchi}. Hatsu pocchi acts a joker tile when drawn with an open tenpai hand."
msgstr "其中一张发 %{6z} 被替换为发发财 %{hatsu_pocchi}。发发财在副露听牌的手牌中摸到时可作为王牌。"

msgid "One of the green dragons is red and acts as aka dora. %{akahatsu}"
msgstr "其中一张发为红色，作为赤宝牌。%{akahatsu}"

msgid "One of the red dragons is the golden chun, which can be used as a five of any suit, and grants 1 extra han when used as a five. %{golden_chun}"
msgstr "其中一张中为金中，可作为任何花色的五，用作五时给予 1 额外番。%{golden_chun}"

msgid "One of the white dragons %{5z} and one of the red dragons %{7z} are replaced with shiro pocchi %{shiro_pocchi}. Shiro pocchi acts a joker tile when drawn while in riichi."
msgstr "其中一张白 %{5z} 及其中一张中 %{7z} 被替换为白发财 %{shiro_pocchi}。白发财在立直中摸到时可作为王牌。"

msgid "One of the white dragons %{5z} is replaced with a shiro pocchi %{shiro_pocchi}. Shiro pocchi acts a joker tile when drawn while in riichi."
msgstr "其中一张白 %{5z} 被替换为白发财 %{shiro_pocchi}。白发财在立直中摸到时可作为王牌。"

msgid "One of the white dragons is shiro pocchi. Shiro pocchi acts a joker tile when drawn while in riichi."
msgstr "其中一张白为白发财。白发财在立直中摸到时可作为王牌。"

msgid "One thing you'll note is that everybody starts with a score of 35000 instead of 25000."
msgstr "你会注意到的一件事是，每个人的起始分数为 35000 而非 25000。"

msgid "Onjouji Toki"
msgstr "园城寺怜"

msgid "Only allow wins worth 3+ fan."
msgstr "仅允许值 3 番以上的和了。"

